{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2", "label": "Web UI milestone UI-2 Implementation Plan", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_22_web_ui_design", "label": "Web UI design spec (Screens and data flow, Security, Error handling, Milestones)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "adr_0002", "label": "ADR 0002: plain Java without a framework", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "adr_0015", "label": "ADR 0015: who lets people join (telegram.admins)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "adr_0016", "label": "ADR 0016: setup shared between dispatch init and the web UI", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "adr_0018", "label": "ADR 0018: setup's updates and Telegram polling", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_setup", "label": "dispatch.cli.Setup (shared setup logic)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Splits the terminal-free parts of dispatch init (token check, setup Updates long-poll, render, write) out of InitCommand into a standalone class, so both dispatch init and the new web UI's SetupApi share identical logic and byte-for-byte YAML output; nothing is written before the final Write step, mirroring init's behavior."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_initcommand", "label": "InitCommand (terminal front end to Setup)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_cliexception", "label": "CliException (made non-final)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "CliException stops being final specifically so Setup.ConflictException can extend it, while dispatch init still reports a conflict with the same message it prints today."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_apiexception", "label": "dispatch.ui.ApiException", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lets an API route answer with its own HTTP status and error code (e.g. 409 conflict when another process already reads the bot's Telegram updates), distinct from the generic 400-for-CliException/500-for-anything-else handling UiServer already had."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_uiserver", "label": "UiServer (POST routes with JSON bodies)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Adds POST route support (JSON body up to 64 KiB, malformed JSON -> 400, oversized -> 413, unknown path -> 404, wrong method -> 405) so setup and management can be driven by POST calls; every non-GET request already needed the page's Origin header."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_folders", "label": "dispatch.ui.Folders (folder browser listing)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lists only directory names on the machine running Dispatch and whether each is a git clone; it never returns file contents, satisfying the security constraint that only folder names (not content) cross to the browser, and caps listings at 500 entries (MAX_ENTRIES) marking truncation."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_setupapi", "label": "dispatch.ui.SetupApi (setup's HTTP steps)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exposes dispatch init's steps as POST routes, keeping answers in memory until Write (nothing written before). people/next and group/next long-poll Telegram up to 25s; a found candidate stays pending on the server so a request the browser abandoned (e.g. React StrictMode's second effect) never loses anyone. Telegram is read one request at a time via a 'reading' lock."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_uicommand", "label": "UiCommand (registers setup routes)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_projectprobe", "label": "ProjectProbe (opened up for SetupApi)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_projectaddcommand", "label": "ProjectAddCommand.Project record", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_secretsfile", "label": "SecretsFile (beside made public)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_servicecommand", "label": "ServiceCommand.specFor / runningJar", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Splits the background service's Service.Spec construction out of ServiceCommand.install into a public static specFor, so the web UI's SetupApi can install the service without a terminal front end."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_api_ts", "label": "ui/src/api.ts (post client + setup calls)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_useaction", "label": "useAction hook (one call's busy/error state)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_usesetupstate", "label": "useSetupState hook", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_setuppage", "label": "SetupPage component (setup shell)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_whostep", "label": "WhoStep component (personal vs team)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_botstep", "label": "BotStep component (bot token check)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_claudestep", "label": "ClaudeStep component (claude command check)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_commitsstep", "label": "CommitsStep component (commit author)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_uselongpoll", "label": "useLongPoll hook", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Repeatedly calls the server (each call waits up to 25s server-side on Telegram) until it finds something, turning 'quiet' after hintAfterMs; a found value stays pending on the server, so React StrictMode's duplicate effect or an unmount-abandoned request loses nothing."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_folderbrowser", "label": "FolderBrowser component", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_peoplestep", "label": "PeopleStep component (confirm people, QR code)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Runs the person long-poll only in the 'people' phase and the group long-poll only in the 'group' phase, so the page never has two requests waiting on the bot at once; offers 'Stop the background service' when Telegram answers a 409 conflict."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_projectsstep", "label": "ProjectsStep component (pick clones)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_summarystep", "label": "SummaryStep component (confirm and write)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-22-web-ui-2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_09_22_web_ui_2_app_tsx", "label": "App.tsx (Setup or Overview root)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "d